  "worked_solution": "Recall that a dilation of scale factor $k$ is represented by the matrix\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 0 \\\\ 0 & k\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHere, we have $k=5.$ Therefore, the matrix represents a dilation with a scale factor of $5.$",
